  "item_short_desc": "<p>Show unwavering support for first responders, public safety officials, and police with Rothco&rsquo;s Thin Blue Line T-Shirt. Crafted from a soft cotton/polyester blend (100% cotton for Desert Sand with Black Flag), this graphic shirt features a distressed US Flag with a symbolic thin blue line printed on the chest. The tag-less label enhances comfort, making it ideal for extended wear. By wearing this shirt, you express respect and support for those who serve and protect.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "9350",
  "description": "<p>Show unwavering support for first responders and public safety officials with Rothco&rsquo;s Thin Blue Line T-Shirt. Crafted from a soft cotton/polyester blend (100% cotton for Desert Sand with Black Flag), this graphic shirt features a distressed US Flag with a symbolic thin blue line printed on the chest. The tag-less label enhances comfort, making it ideal for extended wear. By wearing this shirt, you express respect and support for those who serve and protect. Not only does this tee make a powerful statement, but proceeds from your purchase also contribute to supporting the families of fallen first responders. Wear your commitment proudly with Rothco&rsquo;s Thin Blue Line T-Shirt.</p>",
